      "content": "The E15 error code usually indicates a water leak issue, so inspecting the drain and water inlet hoses is a good first step. You can visually check all connections underneath the dishwasher for any signs of moisture or drips, as this is often where the leak sensor detects a problem. Allow the dishwasher to sit for a while and thoroughly dry the entire base area before trying to run any cycles again.",
